    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Klown is The Dark Fantasy Graphic Adventure. He helps him to find the Mystery Tower and discover the secrets fields of Wizardrym.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you find The Klown on this mysterious and magical Journey to the Final Destination?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rush throught the Space before the Time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is based upon the modern 80,s tale written by Gilles Villeneuve, The Klown. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For fans of 2D Open World Slow Burn. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maze Runner like game, explore, find and talk to secret Characters to access secret Areas. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings, cinematic, story driven and non linear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret 22 characters and 22 areas to find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short game, about 2 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not an Action Combat, but Puzzled Maze Exploration focused. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amazing graphics and sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Klown is a 2D Open World game inspired on the very good DOS Era genre titles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk, Run, Explore. Find secret passages and characters and discover a Dark Fantasy World full of secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Klown is a modern Maze Runner Adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you find The Klown before your Time runs out?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Klown is The Dark Fantasy Graphic Adventure. He helps him to find the Mystery Tower and discover the secrets fields of Wizardrym.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you find The Klown on this mysterious and magical Journey to the Final Destination?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rush throught the Space before the Time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is based upon the modern 80,s tale written by Gilles Villeneuve, The Klown. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For fans of 2D Open World Slow Burn. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maze Runner like game, explore, find and talk to secret Characters to access secret Areas. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings, cinematic, story driven and non linear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret 22 characters and 22 areas to find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short game, about 2 hours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not an Action Combat, but Puzzled Maze Exploration focused. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amazing graphics and sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Klown is a 2D Open World game inspired on the very good DOS Era genre titles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk, Run, Explore. Find secret passages and characters and discover a Dark Fantasy World full of secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Klown is a modern Maze Runner Adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you find The Klown before your Time runs out?</p>",
